Seriously, this is great!

266
00:15:42,580 --> 00:15:48,380
Seriously, it's good! Seriously, it's good!

267
00:15:48,380 --> 00:15:48,420
Seriously, it's good! Seriously, it's good!

268
00:15:48,420 --> 00:15:48,780
Seriously, it's good! Seriously, it's good!

269
00:15:49,860 --> 00:15:50,520
Whoa!

270
00:15:50,860 --> 00:15:51,860
So close!

271
00:15:52,400 --> 00:15:53,460
Think you can eat that?

272
00:15:53,460 --> 00:15:56,040
Kaanoko-san!

273
00:15:56,920 --> 00:15:57,420
Whoa!

274
00:15:57,560 --> 00:15:58,400
Impenetrable!

275
00:15:58,400 --> 00:15:59,080
Saved!

276
00:15:59,360 --> 00:16:01,820
I can't take it anymore! I'm calling it off!

277
00:16:02,040 --> 00:16:03,020
That's enough already.

278
00:16:06,420 --> 00:16:07,920
What's this rhythm?

279
00:16:12,580 --> 00:16:17,460
Hey there, Bobby-Ryo-san!
Long time no see! Olé!

280
00:16:17,460 --> 00:16:19,080
Joby!

281
00:16:21,220 --> 00:16:22,840
What are you doing here?

282
00:16:22,840 --> 00:16:26,200
We came to Japan with friends on vacation.

283
00:16:26,200 --> 00:16:30,280
We heard Bobby was playing in a soccer match,
so we all came to cheer him on.

284
00:16:36,320 --> 00:16:38,200
Aunt Nick, move!

285
00:16:38,580 --> 00:16:39,620
Alright!

286
00:16:39,620 --> 00:16:40,280
Gimme!

287
00:16:40,980 --> 00:16:41,620
Just go home!

288
00:16:41,620 --> 00:16:42,480
Nick!

289
00:16:48,880 --> 00:16:49,860
This way!

290
00:16:51,000 --> 00:16:52,680
What is this room?

291
00:16:52,680 --> 00:16:53,820
This place is...

292
00:16:53,820 --> 00:16:55,400
Where am I?

293
00:16:55,400 --> 00:16:57,540
It's not "nearby" at all, you know.

294
00:17:00,700 --> 00:17:01,820
Got out!

295
00:17:03,760 --> 00:17:04,880
Wait!

296
00:17:04,880 --> 00:17:06,280
Senpai, wait!

297
00:17:06,280 --> 00:17:07,520
This way!

298
00:17:07,520 --> 00:17:07,920
Yes.

299
00:17:10,920 --> 00:17:14,300
It's pretty lively up there, isn't it?

300
00:17:14,860 --> 00:17:17,600
Did the Olympics start or something?

301
00:17:22,380 --> 00:17:23,960
Dogeh dogeh dogeh dogeh!

302
00:17:24,520 --> 00:17:25,580
Ryo-san, that's...

303
00:17:26,960 --> 00:17:29,341
Essie, Essie,

304
00:17:29,391 --> 00:17:31,580
Essie, Essie!

305
00:17:31,580 --> 00:17:33,100
They're holding a festival!

306
00:17:36,820 --> 00:17:37,540
Senpai!

307
00:17:38,660 --> 00:17:41,800
It's a World Cup commemorative
grand soccer festival!

308
00:17:41,800 --> 00:17:43,220
Please turn back!

309
00:17:43,880 --> 00:17:44,540
What is this?!

310
00:17:45,020 --> 00:17:46,060
S-senpai!

311
00:17:49,420 --> 00:17:50,640
It's not like I don't want to!

312
00:17:51,120 --> 00:17:52,520
I can't take this! Charge in!

313
00:17:55,520 --> 00:17:56,880
Leave it to me!

314
00:17:57,160 --> 00:17:58,460
We can't lose either!

315
00:18:02,220 --> 00:18:07,440
The World Cup commemorative police station street
soccer final has just finished its second half,

316
00:18:07,440 --> 00:18:10,640
and has moved into golden-goal extra time.

317
00:18:16,260 --> 00:18:19,380
Both teams' goals are locked
in a fierce tug-of-war.

318
00:18:22,440 --> 00:18:23,640
Don't come at us!

319
00:18:23,640 --> 00:18:25,660
You go on, come at us, go right ahead!

320
00:18:28,880 --> 00:18:30,020
Don't you come at us either!

321
00:18:39,220 --> 00:18:43,000
Even the top pro players can't keep
up with the power of the old town?

322
00:18:43,000 --> 00:18:45,120
They're dropping out one after another.

323
00:19:16,760 --> 00:19:18,660
Could that be...?

324
00:19:20,600 --> 00:19:22,960
This is the World Cup match venue!

325
00:19:35,040 --> 00:19:37,220
Senpai, please turn back!

326
00:19:37,220 --> 00:19:39,160
Komachi, stop!

327
00:19:40,120 --> 00:19:42,060
Stop! Stop!

328
00:19:42,520 --> 00:19:44,820
It's no good! They can't hear us at all!

329
00:19:44,960 --> 00:19:45,760
Throw it! Throw it!

330
00:19:58,620 --> 00:20:00,120
Where's the ball?

331
00:20:01,020 --> 00:20:02,240
Ryotsu, the ball!

332
00:20:04,320 --> 00:20:05,740
Here it comes, Sagonji!

333
00:20:07,140 --> 00:20:07,880
Damn it!

334
00:20:08,360 --> 00:20:09,740
I'll finish it with this!

335
00:20:10,840 --> 00:20:12,360
Let's run over there!

336
00:20:19,140 --> 00:20:20,380
What's with this mess?

337
00:20:20,380 --> 00:20:22,480
Take this, my bullet shot!

338
00:20:43,600 --> 00:20:45,680
Goal! Goal! Goal!

339
00:20:46,440 --> 00:20:47,520
Yay!

340
00:20:50,680 --> 00:20:52,000
We lost!

341
00:20:52,780 --> 00:20:55,220
We did it! Golden goal, we win!

342
00:20:55,220 --> 00:20:58,760
The winner of the World Cup commemorative
police station street soccer tournament is

343
00:20:58,760 --> 00:21:00,900
Ryotsu's team!

344
00:21:08,160 --> 00:21:09,220
Yay!

345
00:21:11,740 --> 00:21:12,500
It's ours!

346
00:21:13,460 --> 00:21:14,180
Ryotsu!

347
00:21:14,560 --> 00:21:16,280
Chief, Chief!

348
00:21:17,000 --> 00:21:17,880
No, I won it!

349
00:21:19,180 --> 00:21:21,360
We won the championship!
Give us the tickets!

350
00:21:22,660 --> 00:21:24,800
Ryotsu, you good-for-nothing!

351
00:21:26,020 --> 00:21:28,960
No, this one, right! This is what I wanted!

352
00:21:29,560 --> 00:21:30,780
No, Ryo-san -

353
00:22:01,120 --> 00:22:03,680
Wasn't the next Olympics in Athens?

354
00:22:04,020 --> 00:22:07,060
No, no, it was suddenly
decided to hold it in Japan too.

355
00:22:07,260 --> 00:22:09,422
It's become a joint hosting
between Japan and Greece,

356
00:22:09,472 --> 00:22:12,100
so some of the events
are going to be held here.

357
00:22:12,500 --> 00:22:14,096
I see, so that's how it is.

358
00:22:14,146 --> 00:22:16,840
That's why soccer is being played in Japan.

359
00:22:21,380 --> 00:22:23,451
But it's really lively.

360
00:22:23,501 --> 00:22:25,460
It's like the World Cup.

361
00:22:25,880 --> 00:22:28,840
Not like it, it's the real World Cup.

362
00:22:29,200 --> 00:22:30,280
Olé!

363
00:22:31,900 --> 00:22:36,100
The 2002 World Cup is being held right now!

364
00:22:37,300 --> 00:22:38,580
2002?

365
00:22:38,580 --> 00:22:41,680
Not 2004?

366
00:22:41,680 --> 00:22:43,200
Good grief.

367
00:22:43,200 --> 00:22:46,580
So I've only been asleep for two years?

368
00:22:46,580 --> 00:22:49,380
How could you wake me up like this?

369
00:22:49,380 --> 00:22:51,420
I don't know, I didn't do anything.

370
00:22:51,420 --> 00:22:53,160
Rio-chan

371
00:23:02,120 --> 00:23:03,900
The World Cup tickets...

372
00:23:03,900 --> 00:23:06,240
How dare you, how dare you, how dare you!

373
00:23:06,760 --> 00:23:11,840
How dare you!

374
00:23:20,300 --> 00:23:21,900
Don't come over here!

375
00:23:21,900 --> 00:23:23,020
No way!

376
00:23:23,020 --> 00:23:25,000
How dare you!

377
00:23:25,000 --> 00:23:26,660
How dare you!

378
00:23:26,660 --> 00:23:27,840
How dare you!

379
00:23:28,880 --> 00:23:30,660
Get away, don't come near!

380
00:23:30,660 --> 00:23:31,480
Get over there!

381
00:23:32,120 --> 00:23:34,020
Well, do something about it!

382
00:23:41,700 --> 00:23:42,100
Alright!

383
00:23:43,720 --> 00:23:45,320
This is a total mess!

384
00:23:45,620 --> 00:23:47,720
Ryotsu, you good-for-nothing!

385
00:23:47,820 --> 00:23:50,820
It's not my fault Higurashi's going wild!

386
00:23:51,060 --> 00:23:53,220
It's your fault in the first place!

387
00:23:53,320 --> 00:23:54,360
W-wait, Chief!

388
00:23:57,720 --> 00:24:00,680
Soccer's become a total pain now!

389
00:24:12,900 --> 00:24:18,440
Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey

390
00:24:19,760 --> 00:24:24,240
To those who play silly
games with their looks

391
00:24:24,240 --> 00:24:27,420
Probably don't want to become that

392
00:24:27,420 --> 00:24:34,340
Dawdling at the corner,
the moon slipped away

393
00:24:34,340 --> 00:24:42,720
Now isn't everything,
so don't get too gloomy about it

394
00:24:42,720 --> 00:24:50,480
Lies, a little cheating,
sometimes helping someone

395
00:24:50,480 --> 00:24:56,680
Baby, do you know me?
Toward tomorrow, a nice spirit

396
00:24:57,740 --> 00:25:04,260
Doing what needs doing with silliness,
a cute spirit

397
00:25:04,260 --> 00:25:11,500
It's hard to understand because
I want it to look that way

398
00:25:12,520 --> 00:25:17,420
Better than fixing your appearance, right?

399
00:25:18,980 --> 00:25:24,880
Nana-na, nana-na, nana-na

400
00:25:30,580 --> 00:25:35,740
Hey, hey, even if picking locks is rampant,
you're locking up way too much!

401
00:25:35,740 --> 00:25:38,840
Honestly, it's just too hard to get inside!

402
00:25:39,200 --> 00:25:42,900
And just what exactly are you
trying to protect by locking so much?

403
00:25:43,540 --> 00:25:47,360
Next time,
the man who locks too much, see you!

404
00:25:48,700 --> 00:25:50,880
That place is Kameari-

405
00:25:51,920 --> 00:25:55,000
Kameari, the marked Kameari

406
00:25:55,000 --> 00:25:59,220
Everyone, come on over to our town!

407
00:26:00,080 --> 00:26:00,780
Thank you

